   "source": [
    "## Python Tuples\n",
    "\n",
    "Tuples:\n",
    "\n",
    "- Tuples are used to store multiple items in a single variable\n",
    "- Tuples are ordered\n",
    "- Tuples are immutable (cannot change or update)\n",
    "- used with round brackets\n",
    "\n",
    "Example:"
   ]
  },
